  "id": "intragroup-conflict",
  "term": "intragroup conflict",
  "definition": "Intragroup conflict is disagreement or a sense of incompatibility among members of the same work group. It can stem from differences about how work should be done or from interpersonal clashes in personality, habits, or style.",
